{"full":"hf:pesu-dev/askpesu","spaceId":"pesu-dev/askpesu","name":"AskPESU","source":"huggingface","description":"A RAG pipeline for question answering about PES University","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","rag","assistant","question answering","pes university","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":6,"created":"2026-05-30T17:06:54.000Z","updated":"2026-09-28T01:17:43.000Z","license":"mit","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://pesu-dev-askpesu.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/pesu-dev/askpesu","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:10.494Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:10.494Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:10.494Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🦀","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Retrieval-augmented question answering about PES University, answered from r/PESU discussions. This Space serves both the API and the web UI from one origin.","A question is rewritten into a standalone query, expanded into several phrasings, matched against a Qdrant collection of Reddit comment threads, reranked by a cross-encoder, and answered with the surviving threads as context. The threads an answer draws on are sent to the client alongside it, with their dates. If nothing clears the relevance threshold the model says so rather than inventing an answer.","The collection it reads is written by AskPESU DB, askpesu-db — one writer, shared by this Space and its dev counterpart. Both agree on the collection's shape through conf/collection.yaml, which each verifies at startup, so a mismatch stops the Space rather than producing quietly wrong retrieval."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/pesu-dev/askpesu/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d62c6f06f7a2d045952d13bde989f2b273ecafc60aa1c0273c43dba4e2493cf3","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:10.565Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:10.565Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Ret